<title>JAPAN: Seibu Oil to shut topper for a month in summer '97.</title>
<headline>Seibu Oil to shut topper for a month in summer '97.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seibu Oil Co Ltd said on Friday it planned to close its 120,000 barrel-per-day crude distillation unit at its Yamaguchi refinery in western Japan for about a month next summer for maintenance checks.</p>
<p>Exact dates for the shutdown are expected to be set by early next year, a Seibu Oil spokesman said.</p>
</text>
